{
  "name": "Marketing — Instagram Auto-Reply (Claude)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Instagram auto-reply (comments + DMs)\nMeta webhook → signature check → dedupe → Claude decides → Graph API actions → log + escalate.\n\n**Setup (Meta App → Instagram → API setup with Instagram login):**\n1. Callback URL `https://<n8n>/webhook/instagram-webhook`, verify token = `META_VERIFY_TOKEN`.\n2. Subscribe fields: `comments`, `messages`.\n3. Permissions: `instagram_business_basic`, `instagram_business_manage_comments`, `instagram_business_manage_messages`.\n4. n8n env: `NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto` (signature check), `META_APP_SECRET`.\n\n**What it does:** comments get a short public reply; booking / price / menu questions also get a private DM; complaints get a public apology + DM + manager alert; spam/abuse is hidden. DMs get answered from `BusinessConfig` facts only.\nKill switch: `IG_AUTOREPLY_ENABLED=false`.",
        "width": 600,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "3be366f1-8e4e-492b-8595-83fa3161ea8e",
      "name": "About",
